// UnitTests.src - the unit-test program of the DUF workspace.
//
// It follows the starter program of the DFUnit library (Templates\UnitTests.src.template). A test program has
// to live in the workspace's own AppSrc, so it is here and not in the library.
//
// Running it:
//     UnitTests64.exe                  the test-runner window
//     UnitTests64.exe -c               unattended: results on the console, then
//                                      exit 0 (all passed) or -1 (a test failed)
//     UnitTests64.exe -c -o result.xml the same, plus JUnit XML for a build server
//     UnitTests64.exe -n               open the window but do not run on startup
//
// Nothing in this file needs to change when tests are added - that is done in oUnit_Tests.pkg.

Use DFUnit.pkg

Object oApplication is a cApplication
    Set psCompany to "RDC Tools International"
    Set psProduct to "DUF Unit Tests"
End_Object

Object oTestApplication is a cDFUnitTestApplication

    // Every test fixture of this workspace hangs off this one file.
    Use oUnit_Tests.pkg

End_Object

// Parses the command line, then either shows the test-runner window or runs the
// tests on the console and exits with the appropriate code.
Send AutoRun of ghoTestApplication
